ol- ler’s legitimate interests; and (e) Upon full performance or termination of the contract, the processor must transfer to the controller any data resulting from the processing that has not already been transferred. The processor must subsequently erase any Principle 12 ALI-ELI PRINCIPLES FOR A DATA ECONOMY"